    {
      "id": "deploy-limits",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 2320,
      "width": 1521.09375,
      "height": 110,
      "fontSize": 22,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "text": "Representative network/mount paths are drawn; Layer 2 expands application calls and returns.\nTerraform provisions VMs/network; Ansible joins/configures hosts; Helm/manifests deploy workloads.\nSupporting framework controllers and databases remain in source manifests; groups are not one Deployment each.\nShared-host executors/replicas and one GPU do not establish host-level HA. Disks persist independently of VM sessions.",
      "angle": 0,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
